Verifier_Version
Command_Schema_Version
Project_Model_Version
Code_Manifest_Version
Changes to verification logic shall therefore remain distinguishable across project history.
Historical verification records shall not silently acquire the semantics of later guardrail versions.

28. VERIFICATION PROVENANCE
